abstract: >-
  Exact cross-subject split definitions, aggregate data cards, and the corpus audit
  behind the manuscript on multi-objective evolutionary joint search of network
  structure and training recipe for lightweight acupuncture-manipulation recognition.
  No raw sensor data is redistributed here.
keywords:
  - acupuncture manipulation recognition
  - multi-objective evolutionary optimisation
  - neural architecture search
  - human activity recognition
  - reproducibility
